(4464321, 640379, 84907, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I am comment only because I just am not really a fan of voting in a challenge I have a shot in, but I really wanted to give a comment on this one.  The expression is just plain priceless, and the hair is hilariously awesome.  The only thing I see at all that catches my eye in a distracting way is the bottom of the shot.  The crop falling where it does can be a bit uncomfortable as it seems to fall in the middle of the bra/sports bra.  That being said if you go lower than this how much lower and where do you draw the line and blah blah blah.  I think it is a fantastic shot and I really hope the voters agree.  Anything less than first page would be a travesty in my humble opinion.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I am comment only because I just am not really a fan of voting in a challenge I have a shot in, but I really wanted to give a comment on this one.  The expression is just plain priceless, and the hair is hilariously awesome.  The only thing I see at all that catches my eye in a distracting way is the bottom of the shot.  The crop falling where it does can be a bit uncomfortable as it seems to fall in the middle of the bra/sports bra.  That being said if you go lower than this how much lower and where do you draw the line and blah blah blah.  I think it is a fantastic shot and I really hope the voters agree.  Anything less than first page would be a travesty in my humble opinion.', '2008-02-06 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
