(4465069, 642674, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to say this does not look too tasty. You brought out some of the meat''s texture, but the veggies look overcooked and I am not sure that I would like to know what''s on the top left of the plate. Also note that the plate is not clean (left) and the wb looks a little warm.</td>', 'I am sorry to say this does not look too tasty. You brought out some of the meat''s texture, but the veggies look overcooked and I am not sure that I would like to know what''s on the top left of the plate. Also note that the plate is not clean (left) and the wb looks a little warm.', '2008-02-06 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465082, 642715, 70689, '<td valign="top">Has a strange, unnatural look. Not my cup of tea</td>', 'Has a strange, unnatural look. Not my cup of tea', '2008-02-06 15:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465097, 641614, 68599, '<td valign="top">oh love the metallic look :)</td>', 'oh love the metallic look :)', '2008-02-06 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465103, 643178, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challenge. Great execution too (apart from the minor yellow spill on ''ancient''). I think it should ribbon, but I don''t think it will, because too many voters will think this is not an advert.<br/> <br/>Hope I am wrong though. 9</td>', 'I like your take on the challenge. Great execution too (apart from the minor yellow spill on ''ancient''). I think it should ribbon, but I don''t think it will, because too many voters will think this is not an advert. Hope I am wrong though. 9', '2008-02-06 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465107, 643093, 68599, '<td valign="top">Not really an advertisement looking shot, but i like it in terms of composition.</td>', 'Not really an advertisement looking shot, but i like it in terms of composition.', '2008-02-06 15:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465113, 642747, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp. It would be easy to place text into this. Birds are a distraction but in the real world they''d be cloned out. My only thought is that this would need text to explain what''s being sold, otherwise I''m not sure what the product is. I do see possible cool funny type ad potential with this photo. That''s probably the most important thing. Nice work.</td>', 'Great comp. It would be easy to place text into this. Birds are a distraction but in the real world they''d be cloned out. My only thought is that this would need text to explain what''s being sold, otherwise I''m not sure what the product is. I do see possible cool funny type ad potential with this photo. That''s probably the most important thing. Nice work.', '2008-02-06 15:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465117, 641961, 45631, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Great shot.  The hole tends to draw my eye though.</td>', 'Very clever.  Great shot.  The hole tends to draw my eye though.', '2008-02-06 15:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4465121, 641806, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and product presentation. I''m sure what''s being sold and the comp lends well to text possibilities. Very professional.</td>', 'Great lighting and product presentation. I''m sure what''s being sold and the comp lends well to text possibilities. Very professional.', '2008-02-06 15:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
