(4465160, 643162, 45631, '<td valign="top">Great advertising shot. Love the composition.  I''m thinking the background couple are a little more blurred than I would like and I would like to have the reds on the lipstick and cloth punched up a bit more. (Maybe its that I''m seeing a bit of a yellow cast over the whole picture).  I really like this image, well done - 9.</td>', 'Great advertising shot. Love the composition.  I''m thinking the background couple are a little more blurred than I would like and I would like to have the reds on the lipstick and cloth punched up a bit more. (Maybe its that I''m seeing a bit of a yellow cast over the whole picture).  I really like this image, well done - 9.', '2008-02-06 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
