(4465631, 643006, 88580, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that Old Spice and pianos go together, but it''s a great image.</td>', 'I''m not sure that Old Spice and pianos go together, but it''s a great image.', '2008-02-06 17:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
