(4466086, 641885, 33672, '<td valign="top">Clever title and original idea. Comp is great and draws the viewer through the ad. A filter or a stop down or two would kill the distracting blown highlights on the shirt. Still, very nice work.</td>', 'Clever title and original idea. Comp is great and draws the viewer through the ad. A filter or a stop down or two would kill the distracting blown highlights on the shirt. Still, very nice work.', '2008-02-06 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
