(4467512, 642989, 34041, '<td valign="top">Great title - I laughed out loud and my co-worker peeked over my cube wall to see what I was laughing at. He didn''t get it.</td>', 'Great title - I laughed out loud and my co-worker peeked over my cube wall to see what I was laughing at. He didn''t get it.', '2008-02-07 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
