(4468496, 642995, 57777, '<td valign="top">The box looks a little dirty or scratched up in the upper right corner of it, and the camera is way to dark. Its a very basic product shot, but would be effective if you could get those two things fixed. Also, camera straps usually are an eyesore. Taking if off probably would have helped.</td>', 'The box looks a little dirty or scratched up in the upper right corner of it, and the camera is way to dark. Its a very basic product shot, but would be effective if you could get those two things fixed. Also, camera straps usually are an eyesore. Taking if off probably would have helped.', '2008-02-07 14:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468498, 641453, 57777, '<td valign="top">The whole thing kist seems a bit to blue for me. The staging of JUST the product and layout is very nice, and way to show off the canon logo.</td>', 'The whole thing kist seems a bit to blue for me. The staging of JUST the product and layout is very nice, and way to show off the canon logo.', '2008-02-07 14:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
