(4468506, 642570, 57777, '<td valign="top">catching a logo in focus sometimes, especially when it is in gold, can be very challenging, and this was a great attempt, but the logo is just not sharp enough. Also, to not get the sweet details of a lamborghini in one of their shots may be sinful!</td>', 'catching a logo in focus sometimes, especially when it is in gold, can be very challenging, and this was a great attempt, but the logo is just not sharp enough. Also, to not get the sweet details of a lamborghini in one of their shots may be sinful!', '2008-02-07 14:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
