(4469307, 642347, 33672, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the product is properly displayed or if the message "they don''t make em like they used to" is what you''re trying to sell. A wider crop would display your product better butthe other technicals seem fine.</td>', 'I wonder if the product is properly displayed or if the message "they don''t make em like they used to" is what you''re trying to sell. A wider crop would display your product better butthe other technicals seem fine.', '2008-02-07 20:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469316, 642791, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation and concept. I''m sure of what your selling and I like the "less is more" concept. A bunch of potential here.</td>', 'Nice presentation and concept. I''m sure of what your selling and I like the "less is more" concept. A bunch of potential here.', '2008-02-07 20:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469317, 643063, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and concept. COmp could use a bit more negative space to place eventual text and the focus could be bit sharper but you''re on the right track.</td>', 'Nice idea and concept. COmp could use a bit more negative space to place eventual text and the focus could be bit sharper but you''re on the right track.', '2008-02-07 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469320, 642701, 33672, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I''m sure what the product is and you''ve shown the comp lends itself well to text placement. LIghting seems a bit harsh and perhaps a light tent or fill flash could dispell the distracting shadows.</td>', 'Not bad. I''m sure what the product is and you''ve shown the comp lends itself well to text placement. LIghting seems a bit harsh and perhaps a light tent or fill flash could dispell the distracting shadows.', '2008-02-07 20:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
