(4469339, 642819, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice way to include a technique in your ad. I''m certain to what your selling but perhaps if you included the tea bag you''d have a more complete package.</td>', 'Nice way to include a technique in your ad. I''m certain to what your selling but perhaps if you included the tea bag you''d have a more complete package.', '2008-02-07 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
