(4469445, 642570, 77196, '<td valign="top">You probably had no choice, but the hot highlights work against this shot - especially the one on the bull itself.</td>', 'You probably had no choice, but the hot highlights work against this shot - especially the one on the bull itself.', '2008-02-07 21:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469446, 642134, 31637, '<td valign="top">Yea ok ! did you print them labels?</td>', 'Yea ok ! did you print them labels?', '2008-02-07 21:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469447, 642962, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great work! 9</td>', 'Great work! 9', '2008-02-07 21:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469459, 642988, 77196, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Initial reaction was: What is this? Finally figured it out. The bottle in the background is too OOF, and the key in the foreground is blown out and at an angle that it is hard to recognize. The placement of the liquid doesn''t have any continuity with the bottle, and seems to be just random puddles. Lighting is good except for the too hot key. Nice effect in B&amp;W. The bottle should be OOF, just not quite so much.</td>', 'Good idea. Initial reaction was: What is this? Finally figured it out. The bottle in the background is too OOF, and the key in the foreground is blown out and at an angle that it is hard to recognize. The placement of the liquid doesn''t have any continuity with the bottle, and seems to be just random puddles. Lighting is good except for the too hot key. Nice effect in B&W. The bottle should be OOF, just not quite so much.', '2008-02-07 21:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469460, 642913, 77196, '<td valign="top">Fairly major shadow &amp; can is not parallel with the edge of the photo.</td>', 'Fairly major shadow & can is not parallel with the edge of the photo.', '2008-02-07 21:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469468, 642997, 88136, '<td valign="top">:) my favorite</td>', ':) my favorite', '2008-02-07 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469473, 642537, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, the car is very, very nice. A bit unusual angle, and a bit stretched horizontally, but it has attitude (and that is good). I don''t recognize the car (which probably means it isn''t a US model), which is also good (closest guess would be a 1965 Chevrolet - the V and symbol above remind me of the Chevy markings of the mid-60''s. The V and headlight arrangement also remind me of the early 60''s Cadillac, but the grille and fenders aren''t right...please put what it is in your comments...). But the blown out sky and very light building front in the upper left strongly detract from the shot.</td>', 'For me, the car is very, very nice. A bit unusual angle, and a bit stretched horizontally, but it has attitude (and that is good). I don''t recognize the car (which probably means it isn''t a US model), which is also good (closest guess would be a 1965 Chevrolet - the V and symbol above remind me of the Chevy markings of the mid-60''s. The V and headlight arrangement also remind me of the early 60''s Cadillac, but the grille and fenders aren''t right...please put what it is in your comments...). But the blown out sky and very light building front in the upper left strongly detract from the shot.', '2008-02-07 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469480, 641673, 77196, '<td valign="top">right side is a bit too dark for me. Great concept, and I like the crop &amp; composition a lot.</td>', 'right side is a bit too dark for me. Great concept, and I like the crop & composition a lot.', '2008-02-07 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469489, 642989, 77196, '<td valign="top">Arrrgh! Looks like a 3 to me. Oh, wait, that''s what the trolls say about my shots! The only two comments I''d made about this very nice shot is the hot spots on the top of the heart, and the glass holder does not seem to be quite straight. Your placement of the pearls and pendant is very nice, and the luster on the pearls is captured nicely. I love your title! 7</td>', 'Arrrgh! Looks like a 3 to me. Oh, wait, that''s what the trolls say about my shots! The only two comments I''d made about this very nice shot is the hot spots on the top of the heart, and the glass holder does not seem to be quite straight. Your placement of the pearls and pendant is very nice, and the luster on the pearls is captured nicely. I love your title! 7', '2008-02-07 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
