(4471787, 640219, 56109, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great picture, but as the consumer I''m not sure what you''re advertising. Black coffee? I think you should have added a brand name somewhere in the photo to express specifically what you''re advertising.</td>', 'I think it''s a great picture, but as the consumer I''m not sure what you''re advertising. Black coffee? I think you should have added a brand name somewhere in the photo to express specifically what you''re advertising.', '2008-02-08 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471789, 642997, 55892, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but the shadow needs more clarity. (ven though it is a shadow)</td>', 'I really like the composition, but the shadow needs more clarity. (ven though it is a shadow)', '2008-02-08 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471791, 642988, 56109, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to understand this was a drink and drive ad. Good idea, but I think it needs to be move obvious at first glance.</td>', 'It took me a minute to understand this was a drink and drive ad. Good idea, but I think it needs to be move obvious at first glance.', '2008-02-08 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471794, 643063, 56109, '<td valign="top">Looks just like the ads, but I think it could be sharper.</td>', 'Looks just like the ads, but I think it could be sharper.', '2008-02-08 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471799, 642818, 55892, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2008-02-08 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471804, 642515, 55892, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Where can I get my ticket?  Great contrast with the red train &amp; the subdued snow &amp; earth tones.</td>', 'Wow!  Where can I get my ticket?  Great contrast with the red train & the subdued snow & earth tones.', '2008-02-08 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471808, 642791, 55892, '<td valign="top">Go, Tony (the tiger). Very creative.</td>', 'Go, Tony (the tiger). Very creative.', '2008-02-08 19:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471811, 642962, 55892, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see it was validated.  Now, how on earth did you do that?</td>', 'I''m glad to see it was validated.  Now, how on earth did you do that?', '2008-02-08 19:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471821, 642044, 7743, '<td valign="top">Transition between the table/floor and your background is a little too abrupt (IMO).  To make the transition line softer, move the subject further away from the background and shoot more wide open to decrease the DOF.</td>', 'Transition between the table/floor and your background is a little too abrupt (IMO).  To make the transition line softer, move the subject further away from the background and shoot more wide open to decrease the DOF.', '2008-02-08 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471823, 643184, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  You could have done a hair product advertisement too!<br/> <br/>It looks like your whites are either blown out or just on the verge in some areas.  In this shot it''s not a huge deal but, to my mind, it would be nice to have a little more detail in your model''s sleeves.<br/> <br/>Nice shot though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  You could have done a hair product advertisement too! It looks like your whites are either blown out or just on the verge in some areas.  In this shot it''s not a huge deal but, to my mind, it would be nice to have a little more detail in your model''s sleeves. Nice shot though.', '2008-02-08 19:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471832, 643162, 39679, '<td valign="top">Truly a great ad photo.  The viewer''s eye is immediately drawn to your "product" and the background clearly offers the impression of romance.  Well done.</td>', 'Truly a great ad photo.  The viewer''s eye is immediately drawn to your "product" and the background clearly offers the impression of romance.  Well done.', '2008-02-08 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471838, 642819, 39679, '<td valign="top">OH no!  Another "Splash shot".  As tired as I am getting of them, this was really well done and very appropriate to the challenge.</td>', 'OH no!  Another "Splash shot".  As tired as I am getting of them, this was really well done and very appropriate to the challenge.', '2008-02-08 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
