(4471907, 641247, 32346, '<td valign="top">cool- many people for this challenge took photos of watches, perfumes and beers- this one, is one of the most creative picture of all. :) I always wonder who are those choosy moms, I mean did they did a survey were mothers classified themselves as choosy or non choosy. I guess I just dont like the word, seems to me like cheesy, and cheesy dosnt go with peanut butter. ;)</td>', 'cool- many people for this challenge took photos of watches, perfumes and beers- this one, is one of the most creative picture of all. :) I always wonder who are those choosy moms, I mean did they did a survey were mothers classified themselves as choosy or non choosy. I guess I just dont like the word, seems to me like cheesy, and cheesy dosnt go with peanut butter. ;)', '2008-02-08 20:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4471909, 642487, 32346, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful place!!!!</td>', 'what a beautiful place!!!!', '2008-02-08 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
