(4474366, 642047, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The truck window/mirror underneath the lower snow mobile is a little distracting but overall this is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice capture. The truck window/mirror underneath the lower snow mobile is a little distracting but overall this is a great shot.', '2008-02-10 01:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
