(4474374, 643093, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color. I would probaby like the lighting to be such that there aren''t such deep shadows in the outermost bowl.</td>', 'Nice color. I would probaby like the lighting to be such that there aren''t such deep shadows in the outermost bowl.', '2008-02-10 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474377, 642444, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion and concept. The color treatment doesn''t work for me though, find it distracting.</td>', 'Nice compostion and concept. The color treatment doesn''t work for me though, find it distracting.', '2008-02-10 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474379, 643042, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice but I''m not a fan of the shallow DOF. Think it would look better with both the bottle and glass in focus</td>', 'Nice but I''m not a fan of the shallow DOF. Think it would look better with both the bottle and glass in focus', '2008-02-10 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474381, 641732, 89940, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for quite a while and still can''t figure out what it is.  I''ve never heard of Paco Rabanne so perhaps that would change it for me.</td>', 'I looked at this for quite a while and still can''t figure out what it is.  I''ve never heard of Paco Rabanne so perhaps that would change it for me.', '2008-02-10 01:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474384, 643156, 89940, '<td valign="top">The pose looks very unnatural. I''m guessing you just caught her in mid stride but my initial thought was she was kinda squatting.</td>', 'The pose looks very unnatural. I''m guessing you just caught her in mid stride but my initial thought was she was kinda squatting.', '2008-02-10 01:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474386, 643184, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl, great show of the face and hair. I''m bothered by the blown out white on the hood</td>', 'Very pretty girl, great show of the face and hair. I''m bothered by the blown out white on the hood', '2008-02-10 02:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474387, 642835, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting</td>', 'Nice color and lighting', '2008-02-10 02:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474388, 641932, 89940, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and nice capture. Would like to see the face a little more lit.</td>', 'Cute kid and nice capture. Would like to see the face a little more lit.', '2008-02-10 02:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474391, 642487, 89940, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but I was distracted by the white portion of the sign and trying to figure out what it said.</td>', 'Interesting idea but I was distracted by the white portion of the sign and trying to figure out what it said.', '2008-02-10 02:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474393, 641356, 89940, '<td valign="top">It''s ok but doesn''t really grab me. My eyes were initially drawn to the blurry street sign, then to the house.</td>', 'It''s ok but doesn''t really grab me. My eyes were initially drawn to the blurry street sign, then to the house.', '2008-02-10 02:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4474397, 642689, 89940, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting but don''t really get it. Had to look for 5-6 secs before I could figure out what it was. Hard to tell if there is liquid in the bottle or not (initial thought there was and then wasn''t sure).</td>', 'Nice color and lighting but don''t really get it. Had to look for 5-6 secs before I could figure out what it was. Hard to tell if there is liquid in the bottle or not (initial thought there was and then wasn''t sure).', '2008-02-10 02:05:06.000000', NULL, 1);
