(4475051, 642615, 33672, '<td valign="top">Not bad. The tones are great for the product and there''s plenty of negative space for text. However, I don''t feel that the ring is the most prominant element in the ad. Perhaps more contrast and a different POV would aliviate this.</td>', 'Not bad. The tones are great for the product and there''s plenty of negative space for text. However, I don''t feel that the ring is the most prominant element in the ad. Perhaps more contrast and a different POV would aliviate this.', '2008-02-10 11:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
