(4475263, 642665, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice work here. I like the tilt and that the product is prominant.A little more negative space on the left or right would help place text.</td>', 'Nice work here. I like the tilt and that the product is prominant.A little more negative space on the left or right would help place text.', '2008-02-10 13:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475265, 642567, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very professional.</td>', 'Very professional.', '2008-02-10 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475269, 640470, 33672, '<td valign="top">I can picture this in a Ritz Camera shop poster for a Valentine''s day sale. A bit more space on top would let the creative team place text easier. A bit more contrast and selective color saturation boost would give a bit richer color to the candy. One of the better ads in the theme for its potential.</td>', 'I can picture this in a Ritz Camera shop poster for a Valentine''s day sale. A bit more space on top would let the creative team place text easier. A bit more contrast and selective color saturation boost would give a bit richer color to the candy. One of the better ads in the theme for its potential.', '2008-02-10 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475272, 641664, 33672, '<td valign="top">Emotive photo but I''m not sure what being sold here.</td>', 'Emotive photo but I''m not sure what being sold here.', '2008-02-10 13:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475277, 641161, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept that I could easily see as a tv spot. Product is well presented and has  "Very cold" feel. Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting concept that I could easily see as a tv spot. Product is well presented and has  "Very cold" feel. Nice work.', '2008-02-10 13:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475307, 642425, 68586, '<td valign="top">Realy interesting idea, but I''m not sure the picture looks ''edgy'' enough to make the viewer think he is contemplating jumping.<br/> <br/>Fabulous vantage point though.</td>', 'Realy interesting idea, but I''m not sure the picture looks ''edgy'' enough to make the viewer think he is contemplating jumping. Fabulous vantage point though.', '2008-02-10 13:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4475313, 642997, 68586, '<td valign="top">Good idea and good shadow.<br/> <br/>The objects in the foreground could do with being better lit and slightly sharper focus so they lead the viewer into the picture a little more.<br/> <br/>i wonder whether the picture might have been better with the model included in the picture but just out of focus ? At the moment you are apparently looking across the open packet and over the underware(?) to a wall  - instead of to the lady.<br/> <br/>Still a good effort though and a nice shape to the model  : )</td>', 'Good idea and good shadow. The objects in the foreground could do with being better lit and slightly sharper focus so they lead the viewer into the picture a little more. i wonder whether the picture might have been better with the model included in the picture but just out of focus ? At the moment you are apparently looking across the open packet and over the underware(?) to a wall  - instead of to the lady. Still a good effort though and a nice shape to the model  : )', '2008-02-10 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
