(4476008, 642555, 33672, '<td valign="top">ALmost seems like a nike ad. Nice work. Tones and lighting are great. Logo is displayed well and lets me know what you''re selling. The only distraction is the loose lace under the shoe.</td>', 'ALmost seems like a nike ad. Nice work. Tones and lighting are great. Logo is displayed well and lets me know what you''re selling. The only distraction is the loose lace under the shoe.', '2008-02-10 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476011, 642541, 33672, '<td valign="top">Product is pretty obvious. I laughed at the "Zesty Mint Flavor". COmp and technicals are right on. I''d love to be at the meeting where they decide where to run the ad....</td>', 'Product is pretty obvious. I laughed at the "Zesty Mint Flavor". COmp and technicals are right on. I''d love to be at the meeting where they decide where to run the ad....', '2008-02-10 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476013, 642954, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and everything else about this. Water adds cool effect. SOme ads just don;t need text. This is one of them. 10</td>', 'I like the tones and everything else about this. Water adds cool effect. SOme ads just don;t need text. This is one of them. 10', '2008-02-10 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476016, 642365, 33672, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, I''m not really sure what''s for sale here. Sorry.</td>', 'Even with the title, I''m not really sure what''s for sale here. Sorry.', '2008-02-10 21:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476017, 642833, 33672, '<td valign="top">Really nice job. I like ads where less is more is the main concept as it is here. Product is perfectly displayed with room for text if needed.</td>', 'Really nice job. I like ads where less is more is the main concept as it is here. Product is perfectly displayed with room for text if needed.', '2008-02-10 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476019, 642804, 33672, '<td valign="top">The details are hilarious but would be lost on the impatient viewer. I can''t really tell what you''re selling either but it made me laugh.</td>', 'The details are hilarious but would be lost on the impatient viewer. I can''t really tell what you''re selling either but it made me laugh.', '2008-02-10 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476026, 643145, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too cute... A little lobster head... Ad is interesting but could use a bit more negative space  for text placement on top and perhaps a cleaner shot of the seasoning can. A couple of small adjustments and this could really be a workable ad.</td>', 'Too cute... A little lobster head... Ad is interesting but could use a bit more negative space  for text placement on top and perhaps a cleaner shot of the seasoning can. A couple of small adjustments and this could really be a workable ad.', '2008-02-10 21:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476031, 642999, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a tourisim ad.Comp is great for possible text but photo could use a bluer sky to entice tourists more.</td>', 'Nice idea for a tourisim ad.Comp is great for possible text but photo could use a bluer sky to entice tourists more.', '2008-02-10 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476036, 642703, 33672, '<td valign="top">Best ad so far because I want one of these and that''s the whole idea. If people take the theme description literally this should win. Product and purpose is clearly presented and there''s perfect negative space for possible text. 10</td>', 'Best ad so far because I want one of these and that''s the whole idea. If people take the theme description literally this should win. Product and purpose is clearly presented and there''s perfect negative space for possible text. 10', '2008-02-10 21:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476042, 643006, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better ads. Mainly because of its concept that connects with thier TV campaign. Masterful. Product is well placed with lots of room for text. Sweet! Technicals are perfect too. 10</td>', 'This is one of the better ads. Mainly because of its concept that connects with thier TV campaign. Masterful. Product is well placed with lots of room for text. Sweet! Technicals are perfect too. 10', '2008-02-10 21:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476044, 642399, 33672, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on this would display the product better and let the potential viewer sure of what''s for sale.</td>', 'A tighter crop on this would display the product better and let the potential viewer sure of what''s for sale.', '2008-02-10 21:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476048, 642789, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Product is well displayed and I''m sure of what''s for sale. Personally I''d ask for a deeper DOF to get the total piece in focus to appeal more to the potential buyer.</td>', 'Nice work. Product is well displayed and I''m sure of what''s for sale. Personally I''d ask for a deeper DOF to get the total piece in focus to appeal more to the potential buyer.', '2008-02-10 21:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476053, 642616, 33672, '<td valign="top">Alot of potential here due to the comp and perfect technical aspects of this. Alot of nice negative space lets text flow right in without ruining the balance. Nice.</td>', 'Alot of potential here due to the comp and perfect technical aspects of this. Alot of nice negative space lets text flow right in without ruining the balance. Nice.', '2008-02-10 21:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476059, 641356, 33672, '<td valign="top">I don''t how this is going for you but I made quite a bit of money shooting houses just like this for real estate agents. I''d use a tripod to sharpen it up a bit and perhaps wait for better light.</td>', 'I don''t how this is going for you but I made quite a bit of money shooting houses just like this for real estate agents. I''d use a tripod to sharpen it up a bit and perhaps wait for better light.', '2008-02-10 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476066, 641614, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with great comp and a ton of potential. I love MC shots and this one is one of the better ones. I  might''ve changed the theme to put more focus on the Motorcycle''s power with this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with great comp and a ton of potential. I love MC shots and this one is one of the better ones. I  might''ve changed the theme to put more focus on the Motorcycle''s power with this photo.', '2008-02-10 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476076, 641496, 33672, '<td valign="top">A ton of potential here that should appeal to the DPCers (Or least half of them). The training wheels put emphasis on the lens potential with the system and product is displayed prominantly.</td>', 'A ton of potential here that should appeal to the DPCers (Or least half of them). The training wheels put emphasis on the lens potential with the system and product is displayed prominantly.', '2008-02-10 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476079, 641241, 33672, '<td valign="top">Sweet job here.  I''d almost expect this to be a real ad by Cananda Dry. Background adds a "refreshing feel" to it. Comp is perfect for text and I''m certain what you''re selling.</td>', 'Sweet job here.  I''d almost expect this to be a real ad by Cananda Dry. Background adds a "refreshing feel" to it. Comp is perfect for text and I''m certain what you''re selling.', '2008-02-10 21:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476084, 641866, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice display of product and a clear message. I''m sure what you''re selling. I''d only ask that it be a bit wider crop to give me some negative space for text if needed.</td>', 'Nice display of product and a clear message. I''m sure what you''re selling. I''d only ask that it be a bit wider crop to give me some negative space for text if needed.', '2008-02-10 21:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476166, 642834, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ad. Nice negative space for text placement And product is displayed perfectly. My only pick would be a bit more contrast for the lettering. but overall an outstanding job.</td>', 'Beautiful ad. Nice negative space for text placement And product is displayed perfectly. My only pick would be a bit more contrast for the lettering. but overall an outstanding job.', '2008-02-10 22:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476275, 642719, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Great lighting and DOF.', '2008-02-10 23:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476278, 642804, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I wish the product was more apparent.</td>', 'Great idea, but I wish the product was more apparent.', '2008-02-10 23:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476282, 643169, 88700, '<td valign="top">Clever set up, but I feel like the black rock pulls the focus from the gum.  Either way, great picture.</td>', 'Clever set up, but I feel like the black rock pulls the focus from the gum.  Either way, great picture.', '2008-02-10 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476286, 641160, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great picture!!</td>', 'Great picture!!', '2008-02-10 23:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476288, 643168, 88700, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and set up!  This feels like it should be in a fashion magazine.</td>', 'I love the lighting and set up!  This feels like it should be in a fashion magazine.', '2008-02-10 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476294, 643046, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I love the lighting.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I love the lighting.', '2008-02-10 23:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476298, 642913, 88700, '<td valign="top">I feel like the left side might be a little overexposed, and I wish the composition was more interesting.</td>', 'I feel like the left side might be a little overexposed, and I wish the composition was more interesting.', '2008-02-10 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476301, 642789, 88700, '<td valign="top">I wish both rings were in focus.</td>', 'I wish both rings were in focus.', '2008-02-10 23:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476304, 643154, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I love the composition.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I love the composition.', '2008-02-10 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476308, 642515, 88700, '<td valign="top">I love the use of color in this image!</td>', 'I love the use of color in this image!', '2008-02-10 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476311, 641657, 88700, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I wish the image was brighter and in focused.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I wish the image was brighter and in focused.', '2008-02-10 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476313, 642957, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the colors, but I wish the lighting was just a little dimmer on the name.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the colors, but I wish the lighting was just a little dimmer on the name.', '2008-02-10 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476315, 642954, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2008-02-10 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476319, 642818, 88700, '<td valign="top">Clever composition, but I feel like the lighting is a little too harsh.</td>', 'Clever composition, but I feel like the lighting is a little too harsh.', '2008-02-10 23:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476373, 643168, 66348, '<td valign="top">By far the winner, and if not DPC got it wrong. Everything about this screams Ad! Great lighting, perfect composition, great model, it all works. Well done. 10 from me.</td>', 'By far the winner, and if not DPC got it wrong. Everything about this screams Ad! Great lighting, perfect composition, great model, it all works. Well done. 10 from me.', '2008-02-11 00:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476375, 642962, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow great idea and time you put into this. Love the idea and lighting seems spot on. Great composition as well.</td>', 'Wow great idea and time you put into this. Love the idea and lighting seems spot on. Great composition as well.', '2008-02-11 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476376, 642940, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition. B&amp;W is very nice and sharpness and clarity is right on. 8</td>', 'Great lighting and composition. B&W is very nice and sharpness and clarity is right on. 8', '2008-02-11 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476449, 642444, 83375, '<td valign="top">The WB looks off and the lighting is a little weak.</td>', 'The WB looks off and the lighting is a little weak.', '2008-02-11 00:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
