(4477971, 642615, 89546, '<td valign="top">Colors of the photograph blend very nicely together. The shell with the ring on it appears to come out of the picture and draws the eyes immedeantly.</td>', 'Colors of the photograph blend very nicely together. The shell with the ring on it appears to come out of the picture and draws the eyes immedeantly.', '2008-02-11 12:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4477973, 643046, 89546, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the object make it interseting. But the background also being black makes it hard to see, it doesnt really stand out. Try a lighter background color, but not white as that would bled with your subject.</td>', 'The shadows on the object make it interseting. But the background also being black makes it hard to see, it doesnt really stand out. Try a lighter background color, but not white as that would bled with your subject.', '2008-02-11 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
