(4477983, 642278, 89546, '<td valign="top">Two much background space, you could illustrate the same concept with a little less background. The subject and the background both being white is intersting, and they dont blend together.</td>', 'Two much background space, you could illustrate the same concept with a little less background. The subject and the background both being white is intersting, and they dont blend together.', '2008-02-11 12:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
