(4478216, 642278, 68586, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clean simple shot. Magnificent lighting control, good cropping.<br/> <br/>In an ideal world the line under the base of the chair would be removed - but hey - this is only basic editing  :  )<br/> <br/>My only concern is that the main visible object is a person and not the chair - I even looked up the chair on the Artifort website to see if this was an copy of their style, but alas no . .  Still a really nice shot - Im just not sure how much it sells the chair.<br/> <br/>Chair contents look good though  ; - )</td>', 'Beautiful clean simple shot. Magnificent lighting control, good cropping. In an ideal world the line under the base of the chair would be removed - but hey - this is only basic editing  :  ) My only concern is that the main visible object is a person and not the chair - I even looked up the chair on the Artifort website to see if this was an copy of their style, but alas no . .  Still a really nice shot - Im just not sure how much it sells the chair. Chair contents look good though  ; - )', '2008-02-11 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
