(4478684, 642818, 39679, '<td valign="top">What a great concept.  On my monitor, the whites seem a little blown out.  Other than that, great shot!</td>', 'What a great concept.  On my monitor, the whites seem a little blown out.  Other than that, great shot!', '2008-02-11 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478687, 641806, 12316, '<td valign="top">Cool ...</td>', 'Cool ...', '2008-02-11 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478724, 643167, 33672, '<td valign="top">Wel. less is definitely more in this one. Product is prominantly displayed. This ad is the theme description''s poster child and in a perfect world it would win. A little more negative space to the top or side would help if text placement was needed.</td>', 'Wel. less is definitely more in this one. Product is prominantly displayed. This ad is the theme description''s poster child and in a perfect world it would win. A little more negative space to the top or side would help if text placement was needed.', '2008-02-11 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478779, 643042, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a well set up shot.  I just wish the depth of field were better.  the beer (particularly the head) in focus would really have sold your idea.</td>', 'This is a well set up shot.  I just wish the depth of field were better.  the beer (particularly the head) in focus would really have sold your idea.', '2008-02-11 18:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478794, 642873, 39679, '<td valign="top">Advertising photography is all about details.  You''ve done a nice job or setting up the shot but there are just a few things that would have made your shot better.<br/> <br/>You want to bring the viewers into your scene - make them imagine themselves "using" your product so putting the sprite in a scene (on a picnic table on a sunny lawn for instance) instead of a still life would help.  <br/> <br/>One thing that makes soda pop different is that it''s carbonated so bubbles are always good as is frost on the glass - make me thirsty!  <br/> <br/>Lastly, I avoid using the built in flash as much as I can (except for fill).  Because there are very few shadows the images tend to look "flat". <br/> <br/>Sorry for such a long comment but you''re on the right track and I hope you''ll  play with this image (re-shoot it) and see what you can do.<br/> <br/>Good Luck!</td>', 'Advertising photography is all about details.  You''ve done a nice job or setting up the shot but there are just a few things that would have made your shot better. You want to bring the viewers into your scene - make them imagine themselves "using" your product so putting the sprite in a scene (on a picnic table on a sunny lawn for instance) instead of a still life would help.   One thing that makes soda pop different is that it''s carbonated so bubbles are always good as is frost on the glass - make me thirsty!   Lastly, I avoid using the built in flash as much as I can (except for fill).  Because there are very few shadows the images tend to look "flat".  Sorry for such a long comment but you''re on the right track and I hope you''ll  play with this image (re-shoot it) and see what you can do. Good Luck!', '2008-02-11 19:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478809, 642962, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and very well executed :)</td>', 'Excellent idea and very well executed :)', '2008-02-11 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4478897, 643183, 89420, '<td valign="top">The background of this pic goes well with the advertisment.</td>', 'The background of this pic goes well with the advertisment.', '2008-02-11 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479125, 641160, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice ad. The product is nicely presented and the lime splash adds a nice effect and the whole feel is "refreshing".Comp works for text addition. The only thing is that the bottle seems tilted.</td>', 'Nice ad. The product is nicely presented and the lime splash adds a nice effect and the whole feel is "refreshing".Comp works for text addition. The only thing is that the bottle seems tilted.', '2008-02-11 21:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479129, 642961, 33672, '<td valign="top">Not bad. But I''d be surer of what you''re selling if the crop were much tighter.</td>', 'Not bad. But I''d be surer of what you''re selling if the crop were much tighter.', '2008-02-11 21:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479138, 640408, 33672, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. Product is prominanty and attractively displayed. You also left negative space for text placement. Relly nice work. I like the tones they really fit the product.</td>', 'This is really nice. Product is prominanty and attractively displayed. You also left negative space for text placement. Relly nice work. I like the tones they really fit the product.', '2008-02-11 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479148, 641687, 33672, '<td valign="top">I see this as an ad for "Old time lemonade" you know, the type you remember from when you were a kid? Nice photo with a lot of potential. Could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'I see this as an ad for "Old time lemonade" you know, the type you remember from when you were a kid? Nice photo with a lot of potential. Could use a bit more contrast.', '2008-02-11 21:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479154, 642873, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice product presentation and the comp works for text placement. If you move the product further away from the backdrop, you''ll see less of the distracting texture of it. Also shake the soda up a bit or dip a straw in it to ge the bubble effect. I''ll make the ad more appealing.</td>', 'Nice product presentation and the comp works for text placement. If you move the product further away from the backdrop, you''ll see less of the distracting texture of it. Also shake the soda up a bit or dip a straw in it to ge the bubble effect. I''ll make the ad more appealing.', '2008-02-11 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479159, 642444, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation. I like the POV. Beer looks appetizing and I like the clover shape. My only pick is the darkness of the background doesn''t give enough contrast. A little more negative space on top would allow for more balanced text placement.</td>', 'Nice presentation. I like the POV. Beer looks appetizing and I like the clover shape. My only pick is the darkness of the background doesn''t give enough contrast. A little more negative space on top would allow for more balanced text placement.', '2008-02-11 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479174, 642715, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beatiful work here. A near perfect ad. The cup of tea with the box makes me sure of what the product is and everything is perfectly displayed. A little more space on top for possible text a cleaning up the small crumbs under the cookie are my only small picks. I''m still giving it a 10. Good luck!</td>', 'Beatiful work here. A near perfect ad. The cup of tea with the box makes me sure of what the product is and everything is perfectly displayed. A little more space on top for possible text a cleaning up the small crumbs under the cookie are my only small picks. I''m still giving it a 10. Good luck!', '2008-02-11 21:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479175, 642639, 33672, '<td valign="top">Maybe this could be used for a background texture in an ad but I''m really not sure what''s for sale here.</td>', 'Maybe this could be used for a background texture in an ad but I''m really not sure what''s for sale here.', '2008-02-11 21:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479179, 641924, 87318, '<td valign="top">I had to read the title twice to catch the connection :-)</td>', 'I had to read the title twice to catch the connection :-)', '2008-02-11 22:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479180, 642993, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  The lighting on the shoes seems a little weak and they seem a touch out of focus, though.</td>', 'Great idea.  The lighting on the shoes seems a little weak and they seem a touch out of focus, though.', '2008-02-11 22:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479183, 641061, 33672, '<td valign="top">The product translated is "the more desperates". ha ha. Product is well displayed and clear and sharp. Technicals are perfect. A little less centered comp would make text placement easier without killing the balance.</td>', 'The product translated is "the more desperates". ha ha. Product is well displayed and clear and sharp. Technicals are perfect. A little less centered comp would make text placement easier without killing the balance.', '2008-02-11 22:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479188, 642981, 33672, '<td valign="top">Kudos all around. Product is well presented and the background adds to the effect. Blue skies make me think "fresh". wow! nice work! My only pick would be to ask for a less centered comp to be able to add text without losing the balance. 10</td>', 'Kudos all around. Product is well presented and the background adds to the effect. Blue skies make me think "fresh". wow! nice work! My only pick would be to ask for a less centered comp to be able to add text without losing the balance. 10', '2008-02-11 22:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479191, 641608, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like alot of things about this and believe it would make a really effective ad photo. The colors are bright and attract attention. The comp allows for text placement and the texture of the water makes the whole ad more interesting visually.10</td>', 'I like alot of things about this and believe it would make a really effective ad photo. The colors are bright and attract attention. The comp allows for text placement and the texture of the water makes the whole ad more interesting visually.10', '2008-02-11 22:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479192, 642278, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the negative space on this ad.  The technicals are perfect. My only issue is that I''m not really sure what the product is. Perhaps a different POV with the chair more prominant could achieve that effect. A really great photo though.</td>', 'I like the comp and the negative space on this ad.  The technicals are perfect. My only issue is that I''m not really sure what the product is. Perhaps a different POV with the chair more prominant could achieve that effect. A really great photo though.', '2008-02-11 22:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479193, 641687, 87318, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous you can take outside photos like this right now...</td>', 'I''m jealous you can take outside photos like this right now...', '2008-02-11 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479195, 643093, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the color pops on this, and the diagonal the bowls are on add a lot of interest for me. I think that the contrast may need to be toned down a little though.</td>', 'I really like the way the color pops on this, and the diagonal the bowls are on add a lot of interest for me. I think that the contrast may need to be toned down a little though.', '2008-02-11 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479202, 643065, 89277, '<td valign="top">This picture might work better in black and white and lit more dramatically. Also, if the light meter was off center I would like it a lot more. Very cool use of depth of field though.</td>', 'This picture might work better in black and white and lit more dramatically. Also, if the light meter was off center I would like it a lot more. Very cool use of depth of field though.', '2008-02-11 22:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479207, 642940, 89277, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. I like the way the light bounces around the watch.</td>', 'Really great shot. I like the way the light bounces around the watch.', '2008-02-11 22:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479210, 642791, 89277, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t even look like a photograph. Also, it would have been more effective to have a bowl of cereal.</td>', 'This doesn''t even look like a photograph. Also, it would have been more effective to have a bowl of cereal.', '2008-02-11 22:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479215, 642957, 87318, '<td valign="top">Might have been better if the label was more visible.</td>', 'Might have been better if the label was more visible.', '2008-02-11 22:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479217, 643137, 89277, '<td valign="top">Hahah, while a very interesting photograph, it doesn''t exactly make me want to drink it. Could just be me though. I like it a lot though. The simplicity really gives the message "punch" (couldn''t help myself, hahah).</td>', 'Hahah, while a very interesting photograph, it doesn''t exactly make me want to drink it. Could just be me though. I like it a lot though. The simplicity really gives the message "punch" (couldn''t help myself, hahah).', '2008-02-11 22:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479219, 642873, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the refraction artifacts from the mug.  The lighting seems a little harsh.  Maybe another light source would help.</td>', 'I like the refraction artifacts from the mug.  The lighting seems a little harsh.  Maybe another light source would help.', '2008-02-11 22:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479220, 643155, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and the light, the only reason I''m sort of wavering on it is because I''m not exactly sure what the product that is supposed to be sold is. It almost functions better as an abstract photo.</td>', 'I really like the colors and the light, the only reason I''m sort of wavering on it is because I''m not exactly sure what the product that is supposed to be sold is. It almost functions better as an abstract photo.', '2008-02-11 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479221, 641924, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice ecolor scheme and product is prominantly displayed. Comp would allow for text placement and technicals a right on. I think you could of used a shallower DOF to isolate the product better. Also the title (perhaps it was intentional) to me infers "pregnant". I don''t know if this would sell more sauce..</td>', 'Nice ecolor scheme and product is prominantly displayed. Comp would allow for text placement and technicals a right on. I think you could of used a shallower DOF to isolate the product better. Also the title (perhaps it was intentional) to me infers "pregnant". I don''t know if this would sell more sauce..', '2008-02-11 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479225, 641334, 89277, '<td valign="top">The product is out of focus! While I really like the lighting and the idea is pretty cool, the product being out of focus is a real no-no, at least as far as I know</td>', 'The product is out of focus! While I really like the lighting and the idea is pretty cool, the product being out of focus is a real no-no, at least as far as I know', '2008-02-11 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479226, 642615, 29513, '<td valign="top">The subject seems to fade into the background to me.  I might try a more contrasting background.</td>', 'The subject seems to fade into the background to me.  I might try a more contrasting background.', '2008-02-11 22:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479227, 641694, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job. A really nice ad. I''m sure of the product and the its prominantly and interestingly displayed. Comp and DOF allows for easy text placement. Colors are bright and details are sharp. 10</td>', 'Beautiful job. A really nice ad. I''m sure of the product and the its prominantly and interestingly displayed. Comp and DOF allows for easy text placement. Colors are bright and details are sharp. 10', '2008-02-11 22:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479230, 642818, 89277, '<td valign="top">The color is a little washed out, and focusing so close on the mouse you sort of lose the idea that it''s a race. Maybe a finish line and less bright lighting (maybe diffuse it?) would have made your message more readily apparent.</td>', 'The color is a little washed out, and focusing so close on the mouse you sort of lose the idea that it''s a race. Maybe a finish line and less bright lighting (maybe diffuse it?) would have made your message more readily apparent.', '2008-02-11 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479237, 641657, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh and soft on the focus. The product should be more in the forefront.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh and soft on the focus. The product should be more in the forefront.', '2008-02-11 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479238, 642515, 89277, '<td valign="top">With the size of the train in the photograph, it almost feels like it''s a landscape. I like that the train is the only thing really in color, but it gets lost in the background</td>', 'With the size of the train in the photograph, it almost feels like it''s a landscape. I like that the train is the only thing really in color, but it gets lost in the background', '2008-02-11 22:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479240, 641050, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Food is well displayed and presented in an appetizing manner. DOF really controls the viewers attention.Off centered comp makes text placement easy. Very effective ad photo.</td>', 'Nice work. Food is well displayed and presented in an appetizing manner. DOF really controls the viewers attention.Off centered comp makes text placement easy. Very effective ad photo.', '2008-02-11 22:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479242, 641247, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot. Maybe just cos i''m a fan of their peanut butter, but I saw this picture load and it took me a minute to realize that it was just natural bread, but as soon as my head clicked in I got really excited and hungry for a sandwich. Excellent job on the lighting, although I can''t quite tell if it''s diffused well enough.</td>', 'I really like this a lot. Maybe just cos i''m a fan of their peanut butter, but I saw this picture load and it took me a minute to realize that it was just natural bread, but as soon as my head clicked in I got really excited and hungry for a sandwich. Excellent job on the lighting, although I can''t quite tell if it''s diffused well enough.', '2008-02-11 22:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479246, 641455, 89277, '<td valign="top">It looks like you couldn''t make up your mind to fill the photo with the Alamo or the sky. Other than that great b&amp;w</td>', 'It looks like you couldn''t make up your mind to fill the photo with the Alamo or the sky. Other than that great b&w', '2008-02-11 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479250, 642574, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great work. Ice gives the ad a "cold" feel to it. Product is well presented and the photo is perfectly sharp. Tones add to the visual fell and the comp is excellent for text placement in the future. I really like the symmetrical aspect of this too. 10</td>', 'Great work. Ice gives the ad a "cold" feel to it. Product is well presented and the photo is perfectly sharp. Tones add to the visual fell and the comp is excellent for text placement in the future. I really like the symmetrical aspect of this too. 10', '2008-02-11 22:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479251, 642134, 89277, '<td valign="top">I am thirsty. The only thing I would have done differently is lit the glass a little better and taken the foam off so that it was even. Or maybe even let it overflow.</td>', 'I am thirsty. The only thing I would have done differently is lit the glass a little better and taken the foam off so that it was even. Or maybe even let it overflow.', '2008-02-11 22:21:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4479253, 640379, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and execution.  I might try for more contrast and maybe a bit tighter crop.</td>', 'I like the idea and execution.  I might try for more contrast and maybe a bit tighter crop.', '2008-02-11 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479255, 642134, 33672, '<td valign="top">Many would say that it too bitter;) Nice ad. Product placement and presentation are great. Overall look and tones are very appealing.</td>', 'Many would say that it too bitter;) Nice ad. Product placement and presentation are great. Overall look and tones are very appealing.', '2008-02-11 22:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479256, 642566, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the dark and light. The picture might be a little more effective though, if you have a few pieces of chocolate (possibly with a bite taken out of one?) placed in front. Maybe that''s just cos my mouth doesn''t water from packages alone.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the dark and light. The picture might be a little more effective though, if you have a few pieces of chocolate (possibly with a bite taken out of one?) placed in front. Maybe that''s just cos my mouth doesn''t water from packages alone.', '2008-02-11 22:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479260, 640408, 89277, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and the fact that you shot it on glass. I think the reason I don''t really like it is cos it''s a piece of jewelry</td>', 'I really like the color and the fact that you shot it on glass. I think the reason I don''t really like it is cos it''s a piece of jewelry', '2008-02-11 22:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479261, 641868, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice political ad. Message is clearly stated and the negative space leaves room for text placemnent.</td>', 'Nice political ad. Message is clearly stated and the negative space leaves room for text placemnent.', '2008-02-11 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479265, 642521, 89277, '<td valign="top">If you weren''t going to make this exactly symmetrical you should have given more negative space in the photo. Other than that I really like the light and depth of field.</td>', 'If you weren''t going to make this exactly symmetrical you should have given more negative space in the photo. Other than that I really like the light and depth of field.', '2008-02-11 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479270, 643006, 89277, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, simple, very clear, the product is in the forefront and a great visual message that gets the message across. The only objection I have is that some people may not have seen the TV ad and therefore wouldn''t understand why the product is on the piano. Other than that I love this!</td>', 'Hahaha, simple, very clear, the product is in the forefront and a great visual message that gets the message across. The only objection I have is that some people may not have seen the TV ad and therefore wouldn''t understand why the product is on the piano. Other than that I love this!', '2008-02-11 22:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479281, 642701, 89277, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this because while the lighting is good, as is the composition, the writing throws me off. I feel like it should be a company slogan, not a thing for the photo contest. but that''s just me</td>', 'I don''t like this because while the lighting is good, as is the composition, the writing throws me off. I feel like it should be a company slogan, not a thing for the photo contest. but that''s just me', '2008-02-11 22:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479282, 641468, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the way you followed their ad campaign for this. I like the comp and the fact that the product is prominant in the photo. The background adds to the ambiance. I do think that you could''ve cropped this tighter and achieved the same effect while putting more attention on the product.</td>', 'I like the way you followed their ad campaign for this. I like the comp and the fact that the product is prominant in the photo. The background adds to the ambiance. I do think that you could''ve cropped this tighter and achieved the same effect while putting more attention on the product.', '2008-02-11 22:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479284, 642905, 89277, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, and not just cos there''s French in it. The lighting is superb, but I don''t know what the product is.</td>', 'I like this a lot, and not just cos there''s French in it. The lighting is superb, but I don''t know what the product is.', '2008-02-11 22:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479287, 641651, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the POV and the calrity of this. I do think you''d need a wider crop to show the product better. Otherwise I wouldn''t be sure whats for sale.</td>', 'I like the POV and the calrity of this. I do think you''d need a wider crop to show the product better. Otherwise I wouldn''t be sure whats for sale.', '2008-02-11 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479288, 642719, 89277, '<td valign="top">I want strawberries right now.</td>', 'I want strawberries right now.', '2008-02-11 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479292, 642541, 89277, '<td valign="top">Really excellent, clever picture! The lighting is great, depth of field is exactly right, the product is in sharp focus. One teeensty problem (and I really am nit picking at this point) is that the S is obscured. Other than that, great!</td>', 'Really excellent, clever picture! The lighting is great, depth of field is exactly right, the product is in sharp focus. One teeensty problem (and I really am nit picking at this point) is that the S is obscured. Other than that, great!', '2008-02-11 22:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479293, 641817, 33672, '<td valign="top">Not a bad ad. I see potential. A tighter crop would lend itself better to crop placement and put more focus on the product. (providing the crop removed some of the negative space to the left)</td>', 'Not a bad ad. I see potential. A tighter crop would lend itself better to crop placement and put more focus on the product. (providing the crop removed some of the negative space to the left)', '2008-02-11 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479294, 643046, 89277, '<td valign="top">This isn''t active enough to make me want to play golf.</td>', 'This isn''t active enough to make me want to play golf.', '2008-02-11 22:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479307, 641275, 89277, '<td valign="top">While I like the concept, and the lighting is very cool for the phone it took me a second to realize where the thing was. Maybe if you had changed the angle?</td>', 'While I like the concept, and the lighting is very cool for the phone it took me a second to realize where the thing was. Maybe if you had changed the angle?', '2008-02-11 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479310, 640327, 89277, '<td valign="top">What is being advertised, the beer or the nachos? My attention is too divided</td>', 'What is being advertised, the beer or the nachos? My attention is too divided', '2008-02-11 22:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479314, 642715, 89277, '<td valign="top">The quality of the photo is a little poor and the colors clash, but I am somehow really attracted to this photo.</td>', 'The quality of the photo is a little poor and the colors clash, but I am somehow really attracted to this photo.', '2008-02-11 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479317, 642913, 89277, '<td valign="top">This is a boring photo.</td>', 'This is a boring photo.', '2008-02-11 22:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479320, 642941, 89277, '<td valign="top">Very effective, makes me wish I drank soda, haha. I think it might be a tad more effective if you put it vertically, though. Other than that, it looks very enticing.</td>', 'Very effective, makes me wish I drank soda, haha. I think it might be a tad more effective if you put it vertically, though. Other than that, it looks very enticing.', '2008-02-11 22:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4479321, 641961, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ad. Product is finely displayed. Ambience is well done through the background and the off centered comp allows for easy text placement and you have almost a leading lines effect here with the fishing pole. I really couldn''t ask for more in an ad photo. 10</td>', 'Beautiful ad. Product is finely displayed. Ambience is well done through the background and the off centered comp allows for easy text placement and you have almost a leading lines effect here with the fishing pole. I really couldn''t ask for more in an ad photo. 10', '2008-02-11 22:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
