(4481050, 643178, 61961, '<td valign="top">Simple and straightforward take on the theme, and the "highlighted" frame makes sense and is actually kind of witty!</td>', 'Simple and straightforward take on the theme, and the "highlighted" frame makes sense and is actually kind of witty!', '2008-02-12 17:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481052, 643006, 61961, '<td valign="top">In terms of exposure, composition, clarity, ,etc., this is surely one the best in the challenge.  I realize you probably lifted the frame color from the Old Spice logo, but I don''t think it helps your photo.  I also wish there was a little more connection between the product and the environment.  Still, a high vote from me.</td>', 'In terms of exposure, composition, clarity, ,etc., this is surely one the best in the challenge.  I realize you probably lifted the frame color from the Old Spice logo, but I don''t think it helps your photo.  I also wish there was a little more connection between the product and the environment.  Still, a high vote from me.', '2008-02-12 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481055, 642497, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m back to bump this from a 9 to a 10.  I keep asking "How did he do this?"  Could be an actual, successful ad, I think.</td>', 'I''m back to bump this from a 9 to a 10.  I keep asking "How did he do this?"  Could be an actual, successful ad, I think.', '2008-02-12 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481057, 641963, 61961, '<td valign="top">I could easily imagine this photo being used in an advertisement for jazz.  Beautiful lights and darks!</td>', 'I could easily imagine this photo being used in an advertisement for jazz.  Beautiful lights and darks!', '2008-02-12 17:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481062, 642819, 61961, '<td valign="top">Typically I''m pretty tired of "drop/splash" photos, but the fact you pulled back and filled the frame with the clear cup and saucer somehow breathes new life into the concept.  I can imagine this photo in a tea ad.  You could probably have cloned out the specks in the lower-left and stayed within the editing rules.  Overall, very well done!</td>', 'Typically I''m pretty tired of "drop/splash" photos, but the fact you pulled back and filled the frame with the clear cup and saucer somehow breathes new life into the concept.  I can imagine this photo in a tea ad.  You could probably have cloned out the specks in the lower-left and stayed within the editing rules.  Overall, very well done!', '2008-02-12 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481078, 643137, 56109, '<td valign="top">Very well done. This will do well, and in my opinion, it might be the best.</td>', 'Very well done. This will do well, and in my opinion, it might be the best.', '2008-02-12 18:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481080, 642962, 56109, '<td valign="top">Wow, really creative. The only thing I think would add to the effectiveness of the photo would be to have shaped the tomato tower into the shape of a ketchup bottle. Just an idea. I think it''s a really great photo though. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, really creative. The only thing I think would add to the effectiveness of the photo would be to have shaped the tomato tower into the shape of a ketchup bottle. Just an idea. I think it''s a really great photo though. Well done.', '2008-02-12 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481085, 641806, 56109, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite from this challenge. Really crip picture and the simplicity works well here.</td>', 'One of my favorite from this challenge. Really crip picture and the simplicity works well here.', '2008-02-12 18:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481086, 642134, 56109, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm, dpc beer. My favortie.</td>', 'Mmmmm, dpc beer. My favortie.', '2008-02-12 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481087, 643167, 56109, '<td valign="top">Really a great idea and creative points for sure. Looks like it took a little work.</td>', 'Really a great idea and creative points for sure. Looks like it took a little work.', '2008-02-12 18:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481088, 642574, 56109, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Good work.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Good work.', '2008-02-12 18:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481089, 641615, 56109, '<td valign="top">haha. I like the title with this pic. Well done.</td>', 'haha. I like the title with this pic. Well done.', '2008-02-12 18:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481094, 642497, 56109, '<td valign="top">Neat. If this isn''t really carved into the wall somewhere your picture has me fooled. Great shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Neat. If this isn''t really carved into the wall somewhere your picture has me fooled. Great shot for this challenge.', '2008-02-12 18:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481095, 641608, 56109, '<td valign="top">My favorite watch shot from the challenge. Great shot.</td>', 'My favorite watch shot from the challenge. Great shot.', '2008-02-12 18:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481097, 643181, 56109, '<td valign="top">Don''t drink the worm! At least that''s what I''ve always been told. Nice shot....so did you drink it?</td>', 'Don''t drink the worm! At least that''s what I''ve always been told. Nice shot....so did you drink it?', '2008-02-12 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481207, 642997, 83313, '<td valign="top">The shadow looks a little odd as if you were shooting at an extreme angle.<br/> <br/>Also, at 38k,your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. I think you have lost some clarity and detail to JPEG compression. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.</td>', 'The shadow looks a little odd as if you were shooting at an extreme angle. Also, at 38k,your file size is a lot smaller than was allowed. I think you have lost some clarity and detail to JPEG compression. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.', '2008-02-12 19:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481210, 643178, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really good. Well composed and heck,... your gonna get lots of other great comments on this, so I''m gonna skip the analysis of this one and press on.</td>', 'Really good. Well composed and heck,... your gonna get lots of other great comments on this, so I''m gonna skip the analysis of this one and press on.', '2008-02-12 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481213, 642982, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit dark. I think a bit brighter might make this cool tech toy stand out.</td>', 'A bit dark. I think a bit brighter might make this cool tech toy stand out.', '2008-02-12 19:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481218, 642278, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does she come with it, or is this a case of "suggested usage only, accessories not included"?</td>', 'Does she come with it, or is this a case of "suggested usage only, accessories not included"?', '2008-02-12 19:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481220, 641180, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess this is a globe, but it''s hard to really tell what I''m looking at.</td>', 'I guess this is a globe, but it''s hard to really tell what I''m looking at.', '2008-02-12 19:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481222, 640408, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well lit and photographed, though i think the view of it is somewhat plain.</td>', 'Well lit and photographed, though i think the view of it is somewhat plain.', '2008-02-12 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481226, 640772, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors. good water drops too.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors. good water drops too.', '2008-02-12 19:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481235, 641615, 83313, '<td valign="top">Knew there would be a lot of camera gear "ads" in this challenge. I like the concept here. Some bright highlights just above the skunk seem to draw my eye away, but overall its good.</td>', 'Knew there would be a lot of camera gear "ads" in this challenge. I like the concept here. Some bright highlights just above the skunk seem to draw my eye away, but overall its good.', '2008-02-12 19:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481238, 642615, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good and well composed, but not quite enough punch in the colors to stand out.</td>', 'Good and well composed, but not quite enough punch in the colors to stand out.', '2008-02-12 19:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481244, 641657, 83313, '<td valign="top">Never heard of the mag. This photo has some appeal, in spite of, or maybe because of, the slight blur. I think this may be a casually done shot that turned out interesting.</td>', 'Never heard of the mag. This photo has some appeal, in spite of, or maybe because of, the slight blur. I think this may be a casually done shot that turned out interesting.', '2008-02-12 19:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481247, 641866, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this has the visual clarity it could have had. Not sure what to suggest, though. I can''t quite nail down what it is.</td>', 'I don''t think this has the visual clarity it could have had. Not sure what to suggest, though. I can''t quite nail down what it is.', '2008-02-12 19:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481250, 642616, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the bottle details. I think perhaps the hand is a little too subdued, but that''s really being picky of me.</td>', 'Nice work on the bottle details. I think perhaps the hand is a little too subdued, but that''s really being picky of me.', '2008-02-12 19:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481252, 643155, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well done. You clearly did a lot of playing around with lighting to get this one right.</td>', 'Well done. You clearly did a lot of playing around with lighting to get this one right.', '2008-02-12 19:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481261, 641961, 83313, '<td valign="top">The message is clear and this is well done, except for one major problem...<br/> <br/>Your file size is only 51k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is hurting your photo in a big way. I can see lots of compression artifacts around the edges of the bottle and the fishing rod. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.</td>', 'The message is clear and this is well done, except for one major problem... Your file size is only 51k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is hurting your photo in a big way. I can see lots of compression artifacts around the edges of the bottle and the fishing rod. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.', '2008-02-12 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481268, 643157, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, except for some visible skew in the bottles on the left. They appear to be leaning in slightly.</td>', 'Pretty good, except for some visible skew in the bottles on the left. They appear to be leaning in slightly.', '2008-02-12 19:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481278, 641664, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it''s supposed to be an ad for, but the photo has merit nonetheless. Cleary a low light shot, the detail is a little soft. Would this shot be an "out of the box" shot, or would "in the box" be more accurate for this one?</td>', 'Not sure what it''s supposed to be an ad for, but the photo has merit nonetheless. Cleary a low light shot, the detail is a little soft. Would this shot be an "out of the box" shot, or would "in the box" be more accurate for this one?', '2008-02-12 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481280, 642703, 83313, '<td valign="top">Are we advertising DPC, or the Ipod touch?</td>', 'Are we advertising DPC, or the Ipod touch?', '2008-02-12 19:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481285, 641817, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fairly pixelated. This was no doubt taken from a fair distance and cropped a lot.</td>', 'Fairly pixelated. This was no doubt taken from a fair distance and cropped a lot.', '2008-02-12 19:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481288, 641061, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good lighting job. I think you nailed this one. Too bad it had to be squeezed into a mere 640 pixels.</td>', 'Good lighting job. I think you nailed this one. Too bad it had to be squeezed into a mere 640 pixels.', '2008-02-12 19:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481293, 641963, 83313, '<td valign="top">All those smooth curves lost a lot in the downsizing to 640 pixles. That''s no shortcoming of the pic, though. Nice work on this.</td>', 'All those smooth curves lost a lot in the downsizing to 640 pixles. That''s no shortcoming of the pic, though. Nice work on this.', '2008-02-12 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481297, 642950, 83313, '<td valign="top">All the advertisement I need! I love peeps. They need to STOP making them for every holiday or I will never be able to overcome my peeps addiction.</td>', 'All the advertisement I need! I love peeps. They need to STOP making them for every holiday or I will never be able to overcome my peeps addiction.', '2008-02-12 19:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481303, 641241, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the dark background in this or not, but the product in the foreground is done is a very appealing manner.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the dark background in this or not, but the product in the foreground is done is a very appealing manner.', '2008-02-12 19:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481308, 642764, 83313, '<td valign="top">i think the details on the bottle needed to stand out a little more, otherwise this is pretty good.</td>', 'i think the details on the bottle needed to stand out a little more, otherwise this is pretty good.', '2008-02-12 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481311, 641932, 83313, '<td valign="top">Could be called a shoehorn, looks like a photo of the kid more than of the product.</td>', 'Could be called a shoehorn, looks like a photo of the kid more than of the product.', '2008-02-12 20:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481315, 641496, 55892, '<td valign="top">Creativity &amp; humor too!  This just HAS to be the winner!</td>', 'Creativity & humor too!  This just HAS to be the winner!', '2008-02-12 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481320, 643093, 55892, '<td valign="top">Love the use of colors.  Great symmetry.  Where can I buy them?</td>', 'Love the use of colors.  Great symmetry.  Where can I buy them?', '2008-02-12 20:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481321, 643137, 55892, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The fluid path is wonderful, punching right in the eye!</td>', 'Great shot!  The fluid path is wonderful, punching right in the eye!', '2008-02-12 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481364, 640470, 55892, '<td valign="top">Just in time for Valentine''s Day!   The green light in the lens suggests a living entity.</td>', 'Just in time for Valentine''s Day!   The green light in the lens suggests a living entity.', '2008-02-12 20:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481365, 643064, 89287, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!</td>', 'Great lighting!', '2008-02-12 20:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481369, 643046, 89287, '<td valign="top">Awesome Lighting,<br/>Great flow to this shot,<br/>Makes me want to tee up!</td>', 'Awesome Lighting,Great flow to this shot,Makes me want to tee up!', '2008-02-12 20:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481374, 642497, 88700, '<td valign="top">Wow, great composition.  How''d you get this picture?</td>', 'Wow, great composition.  How''d you get this picture?', '2008-02-12 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481375, 641694, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF and simplicity.  Reminds me of the view I would get if I put my eye right near the bottle without my glasses on!  Might play with some different crops or angles for more interest.</td>', 'Like the DOF and simplicity.  Reminds me of the view I would get if I put my eye right near the bottle without my glasses on!  Might play with some different crops or angles for more interest.', '2008-02-12 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481378, 642962, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great picture!!</td>', 'Great picture!!', '2008-02-12 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481382, 642873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good idea to include the filled glass with ice to look more appealing.  I would suggest a few changes - move the glass and bottle farther from the background, smooth out the background wrinkles, use a less shiny background if you have one, and put a light on the other side to reduce or eliminate the shadows.</td>', 'Good idea to include the filled glass with ice to look more appealing.  I would suggest a few changes - move the glass and bottle farther from the background, smooth out the background wrinkles, use a less shiny background if you have one, and put a light on the other side to reduce or eliminate the shadows.', '2008-02-12 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481387, 643166, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not really getting what this is selling.  Sorry.  Diagonal composition is nice and the crystals echo the background blue so I can appreciate it as an abstract sort of shot.</td>', 'Not really getting what this is selling.  Sorry.  Diagonal composition is nice and the crystals echo the background blue so I can appreciate it as an abstract sort of shot.', '2008-02-12 20:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481392, 643048, 65234, '<td valign="top">What kind of business would use a picture like that ... never mind; I don''t want to know.  Interesting idea but I don''t think I would want a card that was significantly smaller than what other people hand out, even if it did have a pretty picture on it.  Your composition is nicely done and I like the lighting and shadows, though.</td>', 'What kind of business would use a picture like that ... never mind; I don''t want to know.  Interesting idea but I don''t think I would want a card that was significantly smaller than what other people hand out, even if it did have a pretty picture on it.  Your composition is nicely done and I like the lighting and shadows, though.', '2008-02-12 20:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481395, 641468, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; definitely getting the idea of relaxing on a beach with a Corona.  The blue water sets off the gold of the beer nicely.</td>', 'Nice composition; definitely getting the idea of relaxing on a beach with a Corona.  The blue water sets off the gold of the beer nicely.', '2008-02-12 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481397, 642764, 89287, '<td valign="top">Love the background it plays very well.<br/>Really want to go higher but would have liked to see maybe just a little more light on the label great job</td>', 'Love the background it plays very well.Really want to go higher but would have liked to see maybe just a little more light on the label great job', '2008-02-12 20:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481400, 642819, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done from a technical perspective.  great colors and clarity and interesting composition.  As an ad, I feel like there should be a tea bag or something to identify the brand.</td>', 'Very nicely done from a technical perspective.  great colors and clarity and interesting composition.  As an ad, I feel like there should be a tea bag or something to identify the brand.', '2008-02-12 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481403, 642665, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of fun distortion and nice colors.  Not sure it makes me want to buy or drink it, but it''s interesting.</td>', 'Lots of fun distortion and nice colors.  Not sure it makes me want to buy or drink it, but it''s interesting.', '2008-02-12 20:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481422, 642985, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit.  I''m a little confused by the rocks; I know it<br/>s conventional and probably stereotypical but I expect sand when I think of a natural element associated with Arabia.  And that bracelet is scary!  That perfume must be dangerous stuff.</td>', 'Nicely lit.  I''m a little confused by the rocks; I know its conventional and probably stereotypical but I expect sand when I think of a natural element associated with Arabia.  And that bracelet is scary!  That perfume must be dangerous stuff.', '2008-02-12 21:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481431, 642487, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am *so* tempted to call that phone number!!!  If only I had the money to buy 40 acres like that.  Lovely.  A little oversaturated in the sky, but lovely.</td>', 'I am *so* tempted to call that phone number!!!  If only I had the money to buy 40 acres like that.  Lovely.  A little oversaturated in the sky, but lovely.', '2008-02-12 21:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481437, 642954, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, Guiness.</td>', 'Mmmm, Guiness.', '2008-02-12 21:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481438, 642719, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yep, that looks appealing.</td>', 'Yep, that looks appealing.', '2008-02-12 21:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481441, 643188, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple and to the point.</td>', 'Nice, simple and to the point.', '2008-02-12 21:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481445, 642567, 65234, '<td valign="top">Milk in a wine glass; classy :-)  Looks like a tasty snack.</td>', 'Milk in a wine glass; classy :-)  Looks like a tasty snack.', '2008-02-12 21:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481459, 641468, 74953, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Well placed item and makes me want to get a beer.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Well placed item and makes me want to get a beer.', '2008-02-12 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481462, 642047, 74953, '<td valign="top">Really nice action shot.  Great detail in this capture.</td>', 'Really nice action shot.  Great detail in this capture.', '2008-02-12 21:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481463, 643088, 89287, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp.<br/>love this shot!</td>', 'Nice and crisp.love this shot!', '2008-02-12 21:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481482, 642962, 89287, '<td valign="top">Terrific Shot!<br/>This One I could see as an ad in a magazine!<br/>I see ribbon! Good luck!</td>', 'Terrific Shot!This One I could see as an ad in a magazine!I see ribbon! Good luck!', '2008-02-12 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481521, 641056, 89287, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!<br/>Looks like a 10 to me.<br/>Very crisp clear and to the point,<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Great Shot!Looks like a 10 to me.Very crisp clear and to the point,Good luck!', '2008-02-12 21:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481533, 643155, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, lighting, composition.</td>', 'Very nice colors, lighting, composition.', '2008-02-12 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481542, 642541, 65234, '<td valign="top">OK, that''s funny :-)</td>', 'OK, that''s funny :-)', '2008-02-12 21:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481549, 642950, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, PEEPS :-)))  No Easter basket should be without one.</td>', 'Oh, PEEPS :-)))  No Easter basket should be without one.', '2008-02-12 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481556, 641961, 65234, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think fishing required caffeine.  Isn''t that more of a beer kind of pasttime?<br/> <br/>Point taken anyway.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I didn''t think fishing required caffeine.  Isn''t that more of a beer kind of pasttime? Point taken anyway.  Nice composition.', '2008-02-12 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481572, 643137, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dear me, I don''t know if want a beverage that attacks!  Or is she one of those people with a drinking problem (a la Airplane, the movie)?<br/> <br/>Amusing, great stop-action.</td>', 'Dear me, I don''t know if want a beverage that attacks!  Or is she one of those people with a drinking problem (a la Airplane, the movie)? Amusing, great stop-action.', '2008-02-12 21:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481575, 641061, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting.', '2008-02-12 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481580, 643143, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed; the beads of water on the bottle are a nice touch.</td>', 'Nicely composed; the beads of water on the bottle are a nice touch.', '2008-02-12 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4481586, 642949, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice blues; I like the angle.  Not really sure I want my mouth to feel like an icy cave, but the idea of the gum being refreshing comes across.</td>', 'Nice blues; I like the angle.  Not really sure I want my mouth to feel like an icy cave, but the idea of the gum being refreshing comes across.', '2008-02-12 22:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
