(4481963, 642515, 85849, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the idea didn''t fully come across. Someone mentioned not knowing the product. I didn''t want to mention the O-Train, since only people from Ottawa know the name. It''s not well known. <br/> <br/>The idea was supposed to be that taking this train is easier than driving in heavy traffic. The image is simple and clean like an open road. I don''t think the slogan was enough to suggest it was a commuter train at all.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments and the votes!</td>', 'It''s too bad the idea didn''t fully come across. Someone mentioned not knowing the product. I didn''t want to mention the O-Train, since only people from Ottawa know the name. It''s not well known.  The idea was supposed to be that taking this train is easier than driving in heavy traffic. The image is simple and clean like an open road. I don''t think the slogan was enough to suggest it was a commuter train at all. Thanks for all the comments and the votes!', '2008-02-13 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
