(4482513, 642497, 89494, '<td valign="top">Well, this apple is carved in a wall and upper layer is removed so you can see the bricks. Due to the fact that the wall is old some of the bricks have different color. then just made the shot when light was good in my opinion and also I imagined that shooting the apple on right with the cracks in the wall in left would have a bigger impact. After the shot, besides usual contrast and light adjustment I desaturated yellow.<br/>Thanks for voting this.</td>', 'Well, this apple is carved in a wall and upper layer is removed so you can see the bricks. Due to the fact that the wall is old some of the bricks have different color. then just made the shot when light was good in my opinion and also I imagined that shooting the apple on right with the cracks in the wall in left would have a bigger impact. After the shot, besides usual contrast and light adjustment I desaturated yellow.Thanks for voting this.', '2008-02-13 04:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
