(4483373, 642962, 58785, '<td valign="top">Good LORD... a couple of "2"s?<br/> <br/>We should have a survey, some exam or something and kick those guys out... It''s good thing I am not Langdon.<br/> <br/>I still wonder, who and why those people vote such a stupid numbers for photos like this one... Everyone has their own opinion is my a..s, yeah, they deserve name calling.<br/> <br/>Great job here, keep it up ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-13 13:11:44.</i></td>', 'Good LORD... a couple of "2"s? We should have a survey, some exam or something and kick those guys out... It''s good thing I am not Langdon. I still wonder, who and why those people vote such a stupid numbers for photos like this one... Everyone has their own opinion is my a..s, yeah, they deserve name calling. Great job here, keep it up ;)', '2008-02-13 12:42:27.000000', '2008-02-13 13:11:44.000000', 0),
