(4485175, 640327, 89484, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by brownguy:</b></div><hr/><i> What is being advertised, the beer or the nachos? My attention is too divided </i></td></tr></table>Sorry, all! This was my first Challenge, so I am definitely a ''Rookie''!! The ad was supposed to be for a beer (Budweiser Select) and I thought the blue poster board in the open sunlight would make for a good photograph. It might have if I had cropped the photo a little better or rearranged some of the positioning. Thank you all for the comments and my next submission should be much better!!</td>', 'Originally posted by brownguy: What is being advertised, the beer or the nachos? My attention is too divided Sorry, all! This was my first Challenge, so I am definitely a ''Rookie''!! The ad was supposed to be for a beer (Budweiser Select) and I thought the blue poster board in the open sunlight would make for a good photograph. It might have if I had cropped the photo a little better or rearranged some of the positioning. Thank you all for the comments and my next submission should be much better!!', '2008-02-13 21:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4485188, 641961, 80096, '<td valign="top">Hey Eric, I''m right in back of you...that''s a riot. Your Coke bottle and my Rootbeer bottle are right next to eachother. I wonder how that happened? Maybe they wanted to stay together since they were both in the same cooler at Cracker Barrel that Sunday. Hahahaha!</td>', 'Hey Eric, I''m right in back of you...that''s a riot. Your Coke bottle and my Rootbeer bottle are right next to eachother. I wonder how that happened? Maybe they wanted to stay together since they were both in the same cooler at Cracker Barrel that Sunday. Hahahaha!', '2008-02-13 21:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4485653, 642278, 68797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> worst title ever. Nice use of T and a to sell the shot; great lighting and pose. Great negative space and closed eyes, those elements sell the shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know, but what can I say. I only got permission if I mentioned the designer because of this exclusive thing...<br/> <br/>But thnx :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: worst title ever. Nice use of T and a to sell the shot; great lighting and pose. Great negative space and closed eyes, those elements sell the shot.   I know, but what can I say. I only got permission if I mentioned the designer because of this exclusive thing... But thnx :-)', '2008-02-14 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
